================================================================================
ATTRIBUTION
================================================================================

The substrate event-ring (`memopt/substrate/events.py`) and CCA stream
semantics (`memopt/substrate/stream_registry.py`) are influenced by
the design of PyTorch's caching CUDA allocator (BSD-3-Clause). See the
file headers for specific design references.

The classical Markov-chain predictor in `memopt/orchestrator/predict.py`
is a greenfield implementation; the algorithmic shape (transition /
sequential / recency / fallback) mirrors the legacy
`memopt/vmm/_oracle_py.py` for parity with the legacy VMM, but does
not import from it (verified by static AST scan in
`memopt/orchestrator/tests/test_decision_d1_greenfield.py`).
